<title>HONG KONG: Maanshan Iron 1996 net rises 88 percent.</title>
<headline>Maanshan Iron 1996 net rises 88 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million yuan unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (yuan)		   0.0126   vs 0.0067</p>
<p>    Dividend (yuan)	    0.01     vs 0.01</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    81.16    vs 43.20</p>
<p>    Turnover		     6,780.41 vs 6,216.21</p>
<p>    Company name		 Maanshan Iron and Steel Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  May 23 to June 24</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   July 1</p>
<p>NOTE - Maanshan Iron is a mainland Chinese iron and steel producer.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 0.01 yuan vs same.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
